^LAB(95.31,32715,0)="HAVE YOU EVER RECEIVED SERVICE FROM SOMEONE SUCH AS A PLUMBER OR CAR MECHANIC THAT WAS WORSE THAN WHAT OTHER PEOPLE GET"
^LAB(95.31,32716,0)="YOU HAVE BEEN TREATED WITH LESS COURTESY THAN OTHER PEOPLE"
^LAB(95.31,32717,0)="YOU HAVE BEEN TREATED WITH LESS RESPECT THAN OTHER PEOPLE"
^LAB(95.31,32718,0)="YOU HAVE RECEIVED POORER SERVICE THAN OTHER PEOPLE AT RESTAURANTS OR STORES"
^LAB(95.31,32719,0)="PEOPLE HAVE ACTED AS IF THEY THINK YOU ARE NOT SMART"
^LAB(95.31,32720,0)="PEOPLE HAVE ACTED AS IF THEY ARE AFRAID OF YOU"
^LAB(95.31,32721,0)="PEOPLE HAVE ACTED AS IF THEY THINK YOU ARE DISHONEST"
^LAB(95.31,32722,0)="PEOPLE HAVE ACTED AS IF THEY'RE BETTER THAN YOU ARE"
^LAB(95.31,32723,0)="YOU HAVE BEEN CALLED NAMES OR INSULTED"
^LAB(95.31,32724,0)="YOU HAVE BEEN THREATENED OR HARASSED"
^LAB(95.31,32725,0)="YOU HAVE BEEN FOLLOWED AROUND IN STORES"
^LAB(95.31,32726,0)="THE FRESH FRUITS AND VEGETABLES IN MY NEIGHBORHOOD ARE OF HIGH QUALITY"
^LAB(95.31,32727,0)="A LARGE SELECTION OF FRESH FRUITS AND VEGETABLES IS AVAILABLE IN MY NEIGHBORHOOD"
^LAB(95.31,32728,0)="A LARGE SELECTION OF LOW-FAT PRODUCTS IS AVAILABLE IN MY NEIGHBORHOOD"
^LAB(95.31,32729,0)="THIS IS A CLOSE-KNIT NEIGHBORHOOD"
^LAB(95.31,32730,0)="PEOPLE AROUND HERE ARE WILLING TO HELP THEIR NEIGHBORS"
^LAB(95.31,32731,0)="PEOPLE IN THIS NEIGHBORHOOD GENERALLY DON'T GET ALONG WITH EACH OTHER"
^LAB(95.31,32732,0)="PEOPLE IN THIS NEIGHBORHOOD DO NOT SHARE THE SAME VALUES"
^LAB(95.31,32733,0)="PEOPLE IN THIS NEIGHBORHOOD CAN BE TRUSTED"
^LAB(95.31,32734,0)="IF A GROUP OF NEIGHBORHOOD CHILDREN WERE SKIPPING SCHOOL AND HANGING OUT ON A STREET CORNER, HOW LIKELY IS THAT YOUR NEIGHBORS WOULD DO SOMETHING ABOUT IT"
^LAB(95.31,32735,0)="IF SOME CHILDREN WERE SPRAY-PAINTING GRAFFITI ON A LOCAL BUILDING, HOW LIKELY IS IT THAT YOUR NEIGHBORS WOULD DO SOMETHING ABOUT IT"
^LAB(95.31,32736,0)="IF A CHILD WAS SHOWING DISRESPECT TO AN ADULT, HOW LIKELY IS IT THAT PEOPLE IN YOUR NEIGHBORHOOD WOULD SCOLD THAT CHILD"
^LAB(95.31,32737,0)="IF THERE WAS A FIGHT IN FRONT OF YOUR HOUSE AND SOMEONE WAS BEING BEATEN OR THREATENED, HOW LIKELY IS IT THAT YOUR NEIGHBORS WOULD BREAK IT UP"
^LAB(95.31,32738,0)="SUPPOSE THAT BECAUSE OF BUDGET CUTS THE FIRE STATION CLOSEST TO YOUR HOME WAS GOING TO BE CLOSED DOWN BY THE CITY. HOW LIKELY IS IT THAT NEIGHBORHOOD RESIDENTS WOULD ORGANIZE TO TRY TO DO SOMETHING TO KEEP THE FIRE STATION OPEN"
^LAB(95.31,32739,0)="I FEEL SAFE WALKING IN MY NEIGHBORHOOD, DAY OR NIGHT"
^LAB(95.31,32740,0)="VIOLENCE IS NOT A PROBLEM IN MY NEIGHBORHOOD"
^LAB(95.31,32741,0)="MY NEIGHBORHOOD IS SAFE FROM CRIME"
^LAB(95.31,32742,0)="TEACHERS UNDERSTAND MY PROBLEMS"
^LAB(95.31,32743,0)="TEACHERS AND STAFF SEEM TO TAKE A REAL INTEREST IN MY FUTURE"
^LAB(95.31,32744,0)="TEACHERS ARE AVAILABLE WHEN I NEED TO TALK WITH THEM"
^LAB(95.31,32745,0)="IT IS EASY TO TALK WITH TEACHERS"
^LAB(95.31,32746,0)="STUDENTS GET ALONG WELL WITH TEACHERS"
^LAB(95.31,32747,0)="AT MY SCHOOL, THERE IS A TEACHER OR SOME OTHER ADULT WHO NOTICES WHEN I'M NOT THERE"
^LAB(95.31,32748,0)="TEACHERS AT MY SCHOOL HELP US CHILDREN WITH OUR PROBLEMS"
^LAB(95.31,32749,0)="MY TEACHERS CARE ABOUT ME"
^LAB(95.31,32750,0)="MY TEACHER MAKES ME FEEL GOOD ABOUT MYSELF"
^LAB(95.31,32751,0)="MY SCHOOLWORK IS EXCITING"
^LAB(95.31,32752,0)="STUDENTS CAN MAKE SUGGESTIONS ON COURSES THAT ARE OFFERED"
^LAB(95.31,32753,0)="STUDENTS ARE PUBLICLY RECOGNIZED FOR THEIR OUTSTANDING PERFORMANCES IN SPEECH, DRAMA, ART, MUSIC, ETC"
^LAB(95.31,32754,0)="IF THIS SCHOOL HAD AN EXTRA PERIOD DURING THE DAY, I WOULD TAKE AN ADDITIONAL ACADEMIC CLASS"
^LAB(95.31,32755,0)="THIS SCHOOL MAKES STUDENTS ENTHUSIASTIC ABOUT LEARNING"
^LAB(95.31,32756,0)="STUDENTS ARE FREQUENTLY REWARDED OR PRAISED BY FACULTY AND STAFF FOR FOLLOWING SCHOOL RULES"
^LAB(95.31,32757,0)="I USUALLY UNDERSTAND MY HOMEWORK ASSIGNMENTS"
^LAB(95.31,32758,0)="TEACHERS MAKE IT CLEAR WHAT WORK NEEDS TO BE DONE TO GET THE GRADE I WANT"
^LAB(95.31,32759,0)="I BELIEVE THAT TEACHERS EXPECT ALL STUDENTS TO LEARN"
^LAB(95.31,32760,0)="I FEEL THAT I CAN DO WELL IN THIS SCHOOL"
^LAB(95.31,32761,0)="MY TEACHERS BELIEVE THAT I CAN DO WELL IN MY SCHOOL WORK"
^LAB(95.31,32762,0)="I TRY HARD TO SUCCEED IN MY CLASSES"
