^LAB(95.31,46869,0)="""HAS YOUR CHILD HAD PERIODS LASTING SEVERAL DS OR MORE WHEN HE OR SHE FELT DEPRESSED OR IRRITABLE, AND THEN OTHER PERIODS WHEN HE OR SHE FELT EXTREMELY HIGH, ELATED, AND OVERFLOWING WITH ENERGY"""
^LAB(95.31,46870,0)="""HAVE THERE BEEN PERIODS WHEN, ALTHOUGH YOUR CHILD WAS FEELING UNUSUALLY HAPPY AND INTENSELY ENERGETIC, ALMOST EVERYTHING GOT ON HIS OR HER NERVES AND MADE HIM OR HER IRRITABLE OR ANGRY"""
^LAB(95.31,46871,0)="""COMPARED TO OTHER PEOPLE MY LEVEL OF ACTIVITY, ENERGY AND MOOD"""
