^LAB(95.31,46877,0)="""HAVE YOU EVER HAD A TIME IN YOUR LIFE WHEN YOU FELT SAD, BLUE, OR DEPRESSED FOR 2W OR MORE IN A ROW"""
^LAB(95.31,46878,0)="""HAVE YOU EVER HAD A TIME IN YOUR LIFE LASTING 2W OR MORE WHEN YOU LOST INTEREST IN MOST THINGS LIKE HOBBIES, WORK, OR ACTIVITIES THAT USUALLY GIVE YOU PLEASURE"""
^LAB(95.31,46879,0)="""DID YOU GAIN OR LOSE WEIGHT WITHOUT TRYING, OR DID YOU STAY ABOUT THE SAME WEIGHT"""
