^LAB(95.31,46889,0)="""WHEN YOU WAKE UP IN THE MORNING OR FROM A NAP, DO YOU FEEL OUT OF IT AND CONFUSED"""
^LAB(95.31,46890,0)="""DO YOU USUALLY FOLLOW THE SAME SLEEP SCHEDULE, THAT IS, NO MORE THAN A 1H DIFFERENCE IN SLEEP AND WAKE TIMES, ON BOTH WORK OR SCHOOL AND NON-WORK OR SCHOOL D"""
^LAB(95.31,46891,0)="""HOW OFTEN DO YOU REMEMBER YOUR DREAMS - THAT IS, DREAMS THAT OCCUR DURING YOUR REGULAR SLEEP AND NOT WHILE NAPPING"""
^LAB(95.31,46892,0)="""ARE THESE DREAMS VERY INTENSE, DETAILED AND VIVID, LIKE WATCHING A MOVIE"""
