^LAB(95.31,46904,0)="""WHEN YOU ARE NOT SLEEPING IN YOUR USUAL BED, IN A HOTEL ROOM WHILE ON VACATION, OR ON YOUR COUCH WATCHING TELEVISION, DO YOU STILL HAVE PROBLEMS INITIALLY GETTING TO SLEEP, STAYING ASLEEP, OR FALLING BACK TO SLEEP AFTER WAKING UP DURING TH"
