^LAB(95.31,46909,0)="""DO YOU FEEL SO SLEEPY DURING THE D THAT IT INTERRUPTS YOUR NORMAL ACTIVITIES, SUCH AS DRIVING, READING, OR CONCENTRATING AT WORK OR SCHOOL, EVEN WHEN YOU HAVE HAD ENOUGH SLEEP THE NIGHT BEFORE"""
