^LAB(95.31,46915,0)="""DO YOU EVER EXPERIENCE PERIODS OF MUSCLE WEAKNESS, LOSS OF MUSCLE STRENGTH OR LIMP MUSCLES IN ANY PART OF YOUR BODY, SUCH AS THE LEGS OR FACE, WHEN YOU HEAR OR TELL A JOKE"""
